A: <p>To load an image use <code>ImageIO.read(File file)</code>.  It's a newer API, easier to use and better supported.  A tutorial on loading images is here <a href="http://docs.oracle.com/javase/tutorial/2d/images/loadimage.html" rel="nofollow">http://docs.oracle.com/javase/tutorial/2d/images/loadimage.html</a> if you need some more pointers.</p>

